@startuml
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #FCE8E0
autonumber
participant "Game HTTP caller" as P0 <<boundary>>
participant "GameController" as P1 <<controller>>
participant "GameSessionService" as P2 <<service>>
participant "GameSessionRepository" as P3 <<repository>>
participant "Player / GameSession" as P4 <<entity>>
note over P0,P4: Unity and replay callers use this implemented registration contract; live E2E evidence is tracked separately.
P0 -> P1: Register a play session
P1 -> P2: Validate registration
note over P2,P4: Validate source and identity; determine the human/replay solver assignment.
P2 -> P3: Start the transaction
P2 -> P3: Resolve player and lock session
P3 --> P2: Return session state
alt session does not exist
P2 -> P4: Create ongoing session
P2 -> P3: Insert if absent and lock
else same session already exists
note over P2,P4: Keep the existing assignment; reject conflicting session identity.
end
P3 --> P2: Confirm registration
P2 --> P1: Return the assigned solver
P1 --> P0: Use the assigned solver
@enduml